          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly repaired the initial generic reassurance by stating medication uncertainty must be handled first.",
          "quote": "在没弄清医嘱的情况下，利伐沙班和氯吡格雷如果盲目一起吃，大出血的风险是立刻会要命的"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor refocused the conversation from document-reading to emergency screening and medication safety, acknowledging the earlier drift and re-establishing the safe plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00110",
          "explanation": "Doctor shifted priority from document organization to emergency escalation for antithrombotic bleeding risk.",
          "quote": "您昨晚和今早的做法是正确的。在没弄清医嘱前，同时吃利伐沙班和氯吡格雷有大出血风险"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "When the family disclosed that the patient had arrived at the hospital with unresolved medication confusion, the doctor immediately prioritized emergency evaluation over document organization.",
